		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Human-shaped Lords of Karma. Left half is dark grey, right half is stark white. Four arms, each with two forearms. Eight hands, each containing a lidless eye. Lore keepers and meddlers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 56, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +7 (2d6) or 3 ray (far)+7 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Karmic Defense</strong>. When effected by a hostile spell, spellcaster also is effected.</p><p></p><p><strong>Karmic Link</strong>. When damaged by an attacker, CHA 15+ or aeon takes half damage, and the attacker takes half damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
